1
00:00:03,086 --> 00:00:04,921
[BEA] <i>Please forgive me…</i>

2
00:00:06,923 --> 00:00:09,384
<i>for everything I've done wrong.</i>

3
00:00:12,595 --> 00:00:13,596
[BEA SNIFFLES]

4
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,724
<i>If it wasn't for me…</i>

5
00:00:18,184 --> 00:00:21,980
<i>the man who truly loved me</i>
<i>would've still been alive.</i>

6
00:00:25,942 --> 00:00:29,029
<i>I hope you can also forgive my mother.</i>

7
00:00:31,906 --> 00:00:34,617
<i>I promise I'll change for the better.</i>

8
00:00:35,702 --> 00:00:37,662
<i>I'm going to do the right thing.</i>

9
00:00:39,289 --> 00:00:41,416
<i>I was wrong.</i>

10
00:00:42,375 --> 00:00:44,919
<i>I regret everything I've done.</i>

11
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:46,838
<i>I'm so sorry.</i>

12
00:00:48,673 --> 00:00:52,260
<i>Please forgive me. I'm really sorry.</i>

13
00:00:55,263 --> 00:00:56,556
[MARIELA] <i>Bea.</i>

14
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:01,561
<i>Caloy's death…</i>

15
00:01:01,644 --> 00:01:03,354
- [GRUNTS]
- [EXCLAIMS]

16
00:01:03,438 --> 00:01:04,397
[GUNSHOT]

17
00:01:04,481 --> 00:01:07,025
- [GASPS, CRYING]
- [GROANS]

18
00:01:12,614 --> 00:01:14,783
<i>That Billy interfered.</i>

19
00:01:17,035 --> 00:01:22,373
<i>So Billy's the reason Caloy died.</i>

20
00:01:22,457 --> 00:01:24,334
<i>Let's make her pay.</i>

21
00:01:25,293 --> 00:01:28,963
<i>I'll also surrender Mama</i>
<i>if it'll bring peace to everyone.</i>

22
00:01:31,466 --> 00:01:32,509
<i>Pa…</i>

23
00:01:34,093 --> 00:01:36,346
<i>- Pa, I'm really sorry.</i>
<i>- You traitor!</i>

24
00:01:36,429 --> 00:01:38,264
<i>Bea? Bea!</i>

25
00:01:38,348 --> 00:01:40,433
<i>I won't let you!</i>

26
00:01:40,517 --> 00:01:41,768
<i>Ma!</i>

27
00:01:45,271 --> 00:01:46,189
<i>Ma!</i>

28
00:01:46,773 --> 00:01:48,733
<i>Why did you upload this</i>
<i>without my consent?</i>

29
00:01:49,943 --> 00:01:51,402
<i>Look at the comments.</i>

30
00:01:52,570 --> 00:01:53,738
<i>Look at it!</i>

31
00:01:55,073 --> 00:01:56,282
<i>Here.</i>

32
00:01:57,200 --> 00:02:02,413
<i>"LoveList? More like HateList.</i>
<i>You never run out of issues."</i>

33
00:02:02,497 --> 00:02:04,499
<i>"Your CEO is on the news again."</i>

34
00:02:04,582 --> 00:02:07,919
<i>Clearly, this video campaign</i>
<i>you posted isn't enough</i>

35
00:02:08,002 --> 00:02:10,296
<i>to redirect these hate comments.</i>

36
00:02:12,298 --> 00:02:14,259
<i>Let's make her pay.</i>

37
00:02:14,342 --> 00:02:16,594
[MARIELA] <i>Let's make them all pay.</i>

38
00:02:19,931 --> 00:02:25,061
[TRAFFIC NOISE]

39
00:02:25,145 --> 00:02:27,397
[UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING]

40
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:28,565
[OMINOUS STING]

41
00:02:38,992 --> 00:02:40,243
[WOMAN 1] <i>Ma'am, are you all right?</i>

42
00:02:40,326 --> 00:02:42,036
- [WOMAN 2] Miss, you okay?
- Have some water.

43
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,163
[BEA] I'm fine.

44
00:02:43,246 --> 00:02:44,455
- Where's your house?
- Just one sip.

45
00:02:44,539 --> 00:02:46,291
- [MAN] Is everything okay?
- Drink it, ma'am.

46
00:02:46,374 --> 00:02:49,377
- My goodness, poor woman.
- You sure you're okay, ma'am?

47
00:02:49,460 --> 00:02:50,753
- Are you sick?
- Pa.

48
00:02:50,837 --> 00:02:52,130
I'm fine. Thank you.

49
00:02:52,213 --> 00:02:53,590
- Sweetheart.
- Pa.

50
00:02:53,673 --> 00:02:55,717
- What happened?
- It's about Mama…

51
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:57,218
Well, where is she?

52
00:02:57,302 --> 00:03:00,597
[SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING]

53
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:03,516
[MUSIC BECOMES SUSPENSEFUL]

54
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:05,602
- Sir, where are you going?
- [CAR DOOR OPENS]

55
00:03:05,685 --> 00:03:07,604
A shooting incident
has been reported in Estrella.

56
00:03:07,687 --> 00:03:08,855
We have to respond.

57
00:03:08,938 --> 00:03:10,315
But who will watch over us?

58
00:03:10,398 --> 00:03:12,984
Our colleagues are on their way.
Please wait for them.

59
00:03:15,737 --> 00:03:19,908
[POLICE SIREN BLARING]

60
00:03:19,991 --> 00:03:21,367
[GATE HANDLE CLANKING]

61
00:03:22,327 --> 00:03:24,621
[MUSIC INTENSIFYING]

62
00:03:25,204 --> 00:03:30,877
[THEME MUSIC PLAYING]

63
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:32,730
Billy, we just got home.

64
00:04:32,814 --> 00:04:34,691
Later than expected, though,
because of the traffic.

65
00:04:34,774 --> 00:04:36,693
Your father isn't here yet.

66
00:04:36,776 --> 00:04:38,653
Where is he?

67
00:04:38,736 --> 00:04:40,488
He didn't tell me.

68
00:04:41,239 --> 00:04:43,491
- [UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING]
- [TRAFFIC NOISE]

69
00:04:48,579 --> 00:04:50,415
[LINE BEEPS]

70
00:04:50,498 --> 00:04:51,416
Still nothing?

71
00:04:51,499 --> 00:04:52,709
[NERVOUS BREATHS]

72
00:04:58,423 --> 00:05:02,010
By the way, the cops who were
guarding the place have left.

73
00:05:02,093 --> 00:05:05,346
They said their replacements
were on the way,

74
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:07,390
but no one has arrived yet.

75
00:05:07,473 --> 00:05:08,683
What?

76
00:05:09,684 --> 00:05:12,395
All right, Auntie Pres.
I'm on my way home.

77
00:05:12,478 --> 00:05:13,521
Bye.

78
00:05:13,604 --> 00:05:19,569
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

79
00:05:26,075 --> 00:05:31,956
[MUSIC TURNS SINISTER]

80
00:05:41,883 --> 00:05:45,928
[PHONE RINGING]

81
00:05:46,012 --> 00:05:47,180
Enrico?

82
00:05:47,263 --> 00:05:48,389
Hello, Precious?

83
00:05:49,682 --> 00:05:50,641
Uh…

84
00:05:50,725 --> 00:05:53,061
I've been trying to reach you.

85
00:05:53,144 --> 00:05:55,104
Are you and Oliver home?

86
00:05:55,188 --> 00:05:57,315
Yes, we're home.

87
00:05:57,398 --> 00:05:59,108
Why? Is there a problem?

88
00:05:59,734 --> 00:06:01,611
Just be vigilant.

89
00:06:02,153 --> 00:06:04,072
Watch out for Mariela.

90
00:06:04,155 --> 00:06:05,573
What?!

91
00:06:05,656 --> 00:06:06,783
Where's Oliver?

92
00:06:07,283 --> 00:06:08,701
[PRECIOUS] Oliver?

93
00:06:08,785 --> 00:06:15,625
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

94
00:06:26,844 --> 00:06:28,179
What's up, Auntie?

95
00:06:28,888 --> 00:06:30,848
Nothing, I was just checking on you.

96
00:06:31,808 --> 00:06:32,725
Okay.

97
00:06:34,977 --> 00:06:37,438
Oliver's okay. He's in his room.

98
00:06:38,523 --> 00:06:40,066
What about Billy?

99
00:06:40,149 --> 00:06:43,736
She's not here yet.
But she said she's almost home.

100
00:06:43,820 --> 00:06:45,488
[ENRICO] <i>What about the police?</i>

101
00:06:45,571 --> 00:06:47,657
They left a while ago.

102
00:06:47,740 --> 00:06:49,325
[ENRICO] <i>I've called the police station.</i>

103
00:06:49,408 --> 00:06:51,577
<i>Wait for them. They should be there soon.</i>

104
00:06:52,161 --> 00:06:53,454
Okay.

105
00:06:53,538 --> 00:06:54,705
[ENRICO] I'm on my way too.

106
00:06:54,789 --> 00:06:56,082
Just be careful.

107
00:06:57,375 --> 00:06:59,669
Are they okay, Pa? How's Oliver?

108
00:06:59,752 --> 00:07:00,628
They're home.

109
00:07:01,295 --> 00:07:02,505
They're safe.

110
00:07:03,422 --> 00:07:04,632
For now.

111
00:07:04,715 --> 00:07:06,968
For now, Pa. I hope Mama isn't there yet.

112
00:07:07,051 --> 00:07:09,762
Sir, could you drive faster, please?

113
00:07:10,638 --> 00:07:13,099
- [DRIVER] Yes, ma'am.
- We're in a hurry. Please.

114
00:07:19,063 --> 00:07:25,278
[DARK MUSIC PLAYING]

115
00:07:26,404 --> 00:07:27,488
[SWITCH CLICKS]

116
00:07:28,948 --> 00:07:35,288
[DARK MUSIC CONTINUES]

117
00:07:51,804 --> 00:07:53,097
Where's my sharpener?

118
00:07:54,056 --> 00:08:00,730
[UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING]

119
00:08:13,326 --> 00:08:14,785
W-Who are you?

120
00:08:14,869 --> 00:08:20,750
[MUSIC TURNS TENSE]

121
00:08:20,833 --> 00:08:21,792
Billy?

122
00:08:22,293 --> 00:08:23,544
Are you on your way home?

123
00:08:23,628 --> 00:08:24,795
Your father called.

124
00:08:24,879 --> 00:08:26,631
He said we should look out for Mariela.

125
00:08:29,467 --> 00:08:31,469
She might come for us here.

126
00:08:32,094 --> 00:08:33,429
What?!

127
00:08:33,513 --> 00:08:35,515
Auntie, how does he know that?

128
00:08:35,598 --> 00:08:37,350
I didn't get to ask him.

129
00:08:37,433 --> 00:08:40,353
He said he already called the police,

130
00:08:40,436 --> 00:08:42,438
but they aren't here yet.

131
00:08:42,522 --> 00:08:44,023
[OLIVER] What do you need?

132
00:08:44,106 --> 00:08:50,279
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

133
00:08:54,951 --> 00:08:57,286
A-Are you Bea's mother?

134
00:08:57,370 --> 00:08:59,288
P-Please let me go!

135
00:08:59,372 --> 00:09:02,416
Where do you think you're going?
You're gonna tell on me?

136
00:09:03,125 --> 00:09:04,210
Your old house burned down,

137
00:09:04,293 --> 00:09:06,629
yet you still have a nice place to live.

138
00:09:06,712 --> 00:09:11,133
When that happened to us,
we were left with nothing!

139
00:09:11,217 --> 00:09:14,345
I only want my husband back,

140
00:09:14,428 --> 00:09:17,431
but I can't have him because of you!

141
00:09:17,515 --> 00:09:18,558
[GLASS SHATTERS]

142
00:09:18,641 --> 00:09:20,643
- Auntie, what was that?
- Oliver.

143
00:09:20,726 --> 00:09:23,312
Check on Oliver now! Please!

144
00:09:23,396 --> 00:09:25,398
[MARIELA BREATHING HEAVILY]

145
00:09:25,982 --> 00:09:27,775
[OLIVER GASPS]

146
00:09:27,858 --> 00:09:29,735
- Oliver?
- [MARIELA] You and your sister!

147
00:09:29,819 --> 00:09:31,571
- Oliver? Mariela?
- [OLIVER WHIMPERING]

148
00:09:31,654 --> 00:09:33,990
- [MARIELA] It's all your fault!
- Oliver! Oliver!

149
00:09:34,073 --> 00:09:35,241
- Isn't that so?
- Oliver!

150
00:09:35,324 --> 00:09:37,326
- Mariela, don't!
- And you!

151
00:09:37,410 --> 00:09:38,786
- Don't…
- You snake!

152
00:09:38,869 --> 00:09:42,415
Our lives are miserable because of you!

153
00:09:42,498 --> 00:09:44,584
- Mariela, please.
- What?

154
00:09:45,876 --> 00:09:47,128
Drop it!

155
00:09:47,211 --> 00:09:48,462
Kick it over here!

156
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:50,840
- [OLIVER WHIMPERS]
- Hurry!

157
00:09:50,923 --> 00:09:52,008
[KNIFE SLIDES]

158
00:09:52,091 --> 00:09:53,426
[KNIFE CLATTERS]

159
00:09:55,011 --> 00:09:56,721
Please calm down, Mariela.

160
00:09:56,804 --> 00:09:59,682
Calm down and let's talk
about this properly.

161
00:09:59,765 --> 00:10:02,727
We have nothing to talk about.

162
00:10:02,810 --> 00:10:05,771
I will kill you all!

163
00:10:05,855 --> 00:10:08,190
No, Mariela! Don't drag Oliver into this!

164
00:10:08,274 --> 00:10:10,526
Don't hurt him, please!

165
00:10:11,193 --> 00:10:12,445
[MARIELA CHUCKLING]

166
00:10:12,528 --> 00:10:16,324
To hell with all of you!
I'll spare no one!

167
00:10:16,407 --> 00:10:19,702
I'll erase you from our lives for good!

168
00:10:19,785 --> 00:10:22,538
Mariela, just hurt me instead!

169
00:10:22,622 --> 00:10:25,041
Don't hurt Oliver, please.
Take me instead.

170
00:10:25,124 --> 00:10:27,585
- [MARIELA] No. No!
- [CRYING] Please.

171
00:10:27,668 --> 00:10:29,337
Don't you dare come near us!

172
00:10:29,420 --> 00:10:32,006
Go on! I'll slice him right here!

173
00:10:34,342 --> 00:10:35,551
Let's move!

174
00:10:36,552 --> 00:10:37,470
[ENRICO] Come on!

175
00:10:37,553 --> 00:10:39,680
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

176
00:10:39,764 --> 00:10:40,973
Ma?

177
00:10:42,266 --> 00:10:43,392
[BEA] Ma!

178
00:10:43,476 --> 00:10:45,853
What do you want, huh? Tell me!

179
00:10:45,936 --> 00:10:48,147
Do you want to be set free with Bea?

180
00:10:48,230 --> 00:10:50,524
[PRECIOUS] We will drop
all of the charges!

181
00:10:50,608 --> 00:10:52,443
You'll be able to live quietly.

182
00:10:52,526 --> 00:10:55,237
As for Enrico, we've broken up, Mariela.

183
00:10:55,321 --> 00:10:58,741
Would you like me to talk to him
to get back with you?

184
00:10:58,824 --> 00:11:01,452
Please! I'll give you anything!

185
00:11:01,535 --> 00:11:03,204
Just don't hurt Oliver, please!

186
00:11:03,287 --> 00:11:04,622
[BEA] Ma?

187
00:11:04,705 --> 00:11:06,499
- Ma!
- Bea!

188
00:11:06,582 --> 00:11:09,460
- [ENRICO] Mariela!
- Ma, what are you doing? Ma!

189
00:11:09,543 --> 00:11:11,796
Get those two out
or I'm going to kill him!

190
00:11:11,879 --> 00:11:13,339
- Okay, okay.
- No, don't!

191
00:11:13,422 --> 00:11:14,548
- Mariela!
- Hey!

192
00:11:14,632 --> 00:11:17,802
- Ma. Ma, wait. Listen to me.
- Mariela! Open the door!

193
00:11:17,885 --> 00:11:19,720
- They're gone now!
- [ENRICO] Mariela!

194
00:11:19,804 --> 00:11:22,056
- [BEA] Please stop!
- [MARIELA SNICKERS]

195
00:11:22,139 --> 00:11:23,516
Thank you.

196
00:11:23,599 --> 00:11:26,352
I'm on your side, Ma.

197
00:11:26,435 --> 00:11:28,270
- Yes.
- I'm on your side, Ma!

198
00:11:28,354 --> 00:11:34,193
If you do this,
you will be in jail forever.

199
00:11:34,276 --> 00:11:35,736
I don't care!

200
00:11:35,820 --> 00:11:37,780
They've ruined my whole life!

201
00:11:37,863 --> 00:11:39,281
Open up!

202
00:11:39,365 --> 00:11:42,910
Ma, that's not true!
It's not too late!

203
00:11:42,993 --> 00:11:45,538
[BEA] Ma, do not hurt Oliver.

204
00:11:45,621 --> 00:11:47,206
[GRUNTING] Hey!

205
00:11:47,289 --> 00:11:49,333
- Let Oliver go, Ma.
- You're on my side, right?

206
00:11:49,417 --> 00:11:52,545
Yes, I'm on your side,
but please let Oliver go.

207
00:11:52,628 --> 00:11:54,046
Ma, I'm begging you.

208
00:11:54,130 --> 00:11:57,049
- Ma, Ma…
- Okay, I'll let him go.

209
00:11:57,133 --> 00:11:58,175
- Let him go--
- [SCREAMING]

210
00:11:58,259 --> 00:12:01,262
- [FLESH RIPS]
- [EXCLAIMS]

211
00:12:01,345 --> 00:12:02,596
- Bea? Bea!
- [WHIMPERING]

212
00:12:03,180 --> 00:12:04,682
[BEA] Ugh!

213
00:12:04,765 --> 00:12:08,102
[SCREAMING] This is your fault, Oliver!

214
00:12:08,978 --> 00:12:10,855
- [BEA] No! Oliver!
- [MARIELA SCREAMING]

215
00:12:10,938 --> 00:12:12,773
- Oliver!
- Oliver!

216
00:12:12,857 --> 00:12:13,858
Oliver!

217
00:12:13,941 --> 00:12:15,943
- Mariela!
- [MARIELA SCREAMING]

218
00:12:16,026 --> 00:12:17,403
- Mariela!
- Get off me!

219
00:12:17,486 --> 00:12:19,613
- Oliver!
- Stop!

220
00:12:19,697 --> 00:12:20,573
[MARIELA] Bea!

221
00:12:20,656 --> 00:12:22,992
- [ENRICO] Stop it!
- [MARIELA] Bea, I'm sorry!

222
00:12:23,075 --> 00:12:25,619
- [SOBBING] Bea, forgive me!
- [KNIFE THUDS]

223
00:12:25,703 --> 00:12:27,455
[BEA] Oliver!

224
00:12:27,538 --> 00:12:29,957
Mariela, stop it!

225
00:12:30,040 --> 00:12:33,752
- Mariela, stop!
- No! Let me go! My daughter!

226
00:12:33,836 --> 00:12:35,963
[MARIELA SCREAMING] My daughter!

227
00:12:36,046 --> 00:12:36,964
Mariela!

228
00:12:37,047 --> 00:12:38,674
[MARIELA WAILING]

229
00:12:38,757 --> 00:12:40,259
[ENRICO] Mariela!

230
00:12:40,968 --> 00:12:43,888
Mariela, stop it!

231
00:12:43,971 --> 00:12:45,055
That's enough!

232
00:12:45,139 --> 00:12:49,393
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

233
00:12:49,477 --> 00:12:51,103
- [PRECIOUS] Billy?
- [BILLY] Auntie!

234
00:12:52,104 --> 00:12:53,731
Mariela stabbed him.

235
00:12:53,814 --> 00:12:55,024
Let's go, let's go! Oliver?

236
00:12:56,108 --> 00:12:57,568
- [PRECIOUS CRYING]
- [BILLY] Oliver?

237
00:12:57,651 --> 00:13:00,488
Hold on, Oliver. Just hold on.

238
00:13:00,571 --> 00:13:01,655
Billy…

239
00:13:01,739 --> 00:13:03,032
[PRECIOUS] Oliver…

240
00:13:03,616 --> 00:13:05,784
[PRECIOUS CRYING]

241
00:13:05,868 --> 00:13:10,331
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

242
00:13:26,555 --> 00:13:28,140
[MOROSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

243
00:13:28,224 --> 00:13:29,683
Billy, let's go!

244
00:13:29,767 --> 00:13:32,228
[WHIMPERING] Y-Yes, yes.

245
00:13:33,938 --> 00:13:36,065
- [BILLY WHIMPERING]
- [PRECIOUS] Let's go! Let's go!

246
00:13:36,148 --> 00:13:37,900
Let me go!

247
00:13:37,983 --> 00:13:39,318
- Ma!
- [ENRICO] Stop it!

248
00:13:39,401 --> 00:13:41,153
- Where's Bea?!
- Ma, that's enough!

249
00:13:41,237 --> 00:13:43,864
- Let me go!
- [BEA] That's enough! Stop it!

250
00:13:43,948 --> 00:13:45,449
Just stop!

251
00:13:45,533 --> 00:13:47,159
We've hurt too many people!

252
00:13:47,243 --> 00:13:48,953
We've hurt a child!

253
00:13:49,036 --> 00:13:51,080
That's enough, Ma! Enough!

254
00:13:52,122 --> 00:13:53,707
[BEA BREATHING HEAVILY]

255
00:13:53,791 --> 00:13:55,918
We've dragged so many people into this.

256
00:13:56,961 --> 00:13:58,128
[BEA SNIFFLES]

257
00:13:58,837 --> 00:14:01,048
Fine, they've hurt us.

258
00:14:01,757 --> 00:14:03,968
Billy hurt us.

259
00:14:05,052 --> 00:14:07,137
Because we thought that

260
00:14:08,138 --> 00:14:10,057
they stole everything from us.

261
00:14:10,140 --> 00:14:12,518
That's why we wanted to retaliate.

262
00:14:12,601 --> 00:14:14,728
[SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING]

263
00:14:14,812 --> 00:14:16,480
[BEA] But we were wrong, Ma.

264
00:14:18,816 --> 00:14:21,318
What we did was wrong.

265
00:14:24,029 --> 00:14:28,033
We shouldn't have let anger take over us.

266
00:14:28,826 --> 00:14:31,620
We shouldn't have let envy
get a hold of us.

267
00:14:32,538 --> 00:14:36,250
We shouldn't have gone crazy
over our desire to take revenge.

268
00:14:36,333 --> 00:14:37,751
[SOMBER MUSIC CONTINUES]

269
00:14:37,835 --> 00:14:40,838
That's just dragging us down even more.

270
00:14:42,423 --> 00:14:44,174
All because…

271
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:48,637
your husband left you.

272
00:14:50,764 --> 00:14:52,558
Because Papa left me.

273
00:14:53,559 --> 00:14:57,146
- [BEA WHIMPERS]
- [SOMBER MUSIC CONTINUES]

274
00:14:57,229 --> 00:14:59,023
Because you lost a child.

275
00:15:01,525 --> 00:15:04,028
[WHIMPERS] But, Ma…

276
00:15:05,946 --> 00:15:09,283
We forgot that we didn't lose everything.

277
00:15:09,366 --> 00:15:12,036
Because we still have each other.

278
00:15:12,119 --> 00:15:14,580
We're still together.

279
00:15:15,414 --> 00:15:17,875
Right from the start,

280
00:15:17,958 --> 00:15:20,878
we should've worked together
to bounce back.

281
00:15:21,921 --> 00:15:23,380
But, Ma…

282
00:15:25,424 --> 00:15:27,801
Ma, we can still start over.

283
00:15:29,178 --> 00:15:30,262
Right?

284
00:15:31,305 --> 00:15:32,348
Right, Ma?

285
00:15:32,431 --> 00:15:34,016
[MARIELA] It's too late.

286
00:15:34,099 --> 00:15:35,643
[BEA] No, no, no.

287
00:15:35,726 --> 00:15:36,685
It's not.

288
00:15:38,020 --> 00:15:39,480
It's not too late.

289
00:15:39,563 --> 00:15:40,689
No, Ma.

290
00:15:41,190 --> 00:15:43,400
It's not too late
because we're still alive.

291
00:15:44,735 --> 00:15:46,403
We're still alive.

292
00:15:47,696 --> 00:15:51,158
We still have so many chances
to make a change,

293
00:15:52,117 --> 00:15:55,788
to repent for all the wrong we've done.

294
00:15:55,871 --> 00:15:57,081
Ma…

295
00:15:57,998 --> 00:16:00,292
[SOBS] Ma, please stop.

296
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:02,169
Please, Ma.

297
00:16:02,252 --> 00:16:04,088
Just stop this already.

298
00:16:04,171 --> 00:16:05,798
[BEA SNIFFLES]

299
00:16:08,467 --> 00:16:12,721
[MARIELA SOBBING]

300
00:16:16,725 --> 00:16:22,648
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

301
00:16:24,066 --> 00:16:26,318
Ma, I'm here.

302
00:16:26,402 --> 00:16:27,820
I'm right here.

303
00:16:28,862 --> 00:16:30,739
I'll always be here, Ma.

304
00:16:31,740 --> 00:16:33,409
[SOBBING]

305
00:16:33,492 --> 00:16:39,331
[SIREN WAILING]

306
00:16:45,170 --> 00:16:46,338
[GRUNTS]

307
00:16:47,256 --> 00:16:48,507
Pa?

308
00:16:50,467 --> 00:16:52,219
- [BEA] Pa.
- [GROANS IN PAIN]

309
00:16:52,302 --> 00:16:53,762
Pa!

310
00:16:53,846 --> 00:16:55,305
- Pa! Pa!
- [GROANS IN PAIN]

311
00:16:57,224 --> 00:16:58,350
Pa!

312
00:16:59,184 --> 00:17:01,603
- Pa, what's happening?
- [BREATHES HEAVILY]

313
00:17:01,687 --> 00:17:04,189
- Pa! Pa! What's happening?
- [ENRICO GROANS]

314
00:17:04,273 --> 00:17:06,025
- [GRUNTING IN PAIN]
- Pa!

315
00:17:07,109 --> 00:17:12,114
[GLOOMY MUSIC PLAYING]

316
00:17:28,672 --> 00:17:35,554
[GLOOMY MUSIC CONTINUES]

317
00:17:49,902 --> 00:17:55,199
[GLOOMY MUSIC CONTINUES]

318
00:17:59,578 --> 00:18:05,209
[HEART MONITOR BEEPING]

319
00:18:09,338 --> 00:18:15,677
[GLOOMY MUSIC CONTINUES]

320
00:18:33,695 --> 00:18:39,701
[HEART MONITOR BEEPING]

321
00:18:41,787 --> 00:18:47,960
[GLOOMY MUSIC CONTINUES]

322
00:18:50,504 --> 00:18:52,464
<i>This is all my fault.</i>

323
00:18:52,548 --> 00:18:54,007
<i>I'm sorry, dear.</i>

324
00:18:54,091 --> 00:18:56,510
<i>I should've been the one</i>
<i>who got stabbed by Mariela.</i>

325
00:18:59,221 --> 00:19:01,473
<i>I should've been the one who got hurt!</i>

326
00:19:01,557 --> 00:19:04,685
[SOBBING]

327
00:19:06,103 --> 00:19:08,856
<i>I'm the only one to blame</i>
<i>for what happened.</i>

328
00:19:11,150 --> 00:19:12,568
<i>That was on me, Ma.</i>

329
00:19:13,861 --> 00:19:17,114
<i>I've done so many terrible things to you.</i>

330
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:22,286
<i>But despite everything,</i>

331
00:19:23,662 --> 00:19:25,789
<i>you're still here for me.</i>

332
00:19:31,295 --> 00:19:33,797
<i>How is the boy doing?</i>

333
00:19:37,593 --> 00:19:38,760
[SNIFFLES]

334
00:19:40,804 --> 00:19:41,638
<i>Dear…</i>

335
00:19:42,931 --> 00:19:45,309
<i>I really didn't mean for that to happen.</i>

336
00:19:46,018 --> 00:19:49,146
<i>I've caused you so much pain.</i>

337
00:19:49,730 --> 00:19:53,650
<i>I'm sorry, dear.</i>
<i>I wasn't a good mother to you.</i>

338
00:19:55,569 --> 00:19:57,279
<i>But do everything you can</i>

339
00:19:57,362 --> 00:19:59,364
<i>to make sure you don't end up like me.</i>

340
00:19:59,907 --> 00:20:01,909
<i>It's not too late, is it, Ma?</i>

341
00:20:04,620 --> 00:20:05,913
<i>We still have…</i>

342
00:20:07,039 --> 00:20:10,042
<i>We still have many days, many months,</i>

343
00:20:10,125 --> 00:20:12,711
<i>and many chances to change.</i>

344
00:20:14,338 --> 00:20:17,883
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

345
00:20:22,012 --> 00:20:23,347
<i>How is he?</i>

346
00:20:27,851 --> 00:20:28,894
<i>How is he?</i>
